ecking serde_json v1.0.151\n    Checking cursor-delegate-mcp v0.5.0 (/Users/user/work/delegate-12-budgets)\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 2.39s\n","stderr":"","executionTime":2987,"interleavedOutput":"    Checking equivalent v1.0.2\n    Checking hashbrown v0.17.1\n    Checking memchr v2.8.3\n    Checking itoa v1.0.18\n    Checking serde_core v1.0.229\n    Checking zmij v1.0.23\n    Checking libc v0.2.189\n    Checking indexmap v2.14.2\n    Checking serde v1.0.229\n    Checking serde_json v1.0.151\n    Checking cursor-delegate-mcp v0.5.0 (/Users/user/work/delegate-12-budgets)\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 2.39s\n","localExecutionTimeMs":2732},"isBackground":false},"description":"Fmt check and clippy"},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"tool_de3181d5-70d4-4b9b-9751-e676a6a47f8","startedAtMs":"1790851954377","completedAtMs":"1790851957505"},"model_call_id":"03ff5b5c-012a-4c9e-8b5f-f8530a892bb5-29-e4kx","session_id":"23269ead-5209-4ac9-9976-6eab6d468682","timestamp_ms":1790851957419}
